window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Private detective Alex Lockerby never expected to be the prime suspect in a high profile murder case. </b>But when the police find him standing over a body with his fingerprints on the murder weapon, he rapidly jumps to the top of their list.</p> <p>Despite being released on bail, Alex's reputation and business are under attack by mysterious forces. As he fights to clear his name, Alex is pulled into a dangerous world of counterfeiting, murder, and mobsters. With the help of his mentor, his trusty assistant, and a few unexpected allies, Alex races against time to unravel this twisted web of lies and uncover the culprit behind it all.</p> <p>As the truth comes to light, however, Alex must come to grips with the possibility that this case may be his last.</p> <p>If you’re a fan of the Dresden Files, you won't want to miss, <i>Gangster</i>, the latest thrilling fantasy novel in the Arcane Casebook series</p>"; 
